Pangolin CLI
------------

The official Pangolin CLI (fosrl/cli) is a separate program licensed
under the AGPL-3.0. Traygolin runs the installed `pangolin` binary and
does not include, copy or link any fosrl/cli source code.

internal/olm is an independent implementation of the client's local
control protocol (HTTP over the /var/run/olm.sock Unix socket), written
from observed behaviour and public documentation. internal/privhelper
parses only the command line that the CLI passes to `sudo`.


